flowchart TD
    Host[Host policy] --> Apps[Protocol applications]
    Apps --> Vtable[Application callbacks]
    Vtable --> MAD[Declaration state]
    MAD --> Codec[PDU codec]
    MAD --> Clock[Timer port]
    MAD --> Heap[Allocation port]
